      "value": "@{59b5aad1090dc0367f77ce61|full_name}: I think the only problem with this is that it can be time-consuming to type it on VR, or you might not remember the name (or how to spell it). Also the search seems a bit buggy or finicky about how you type it to match the name...\n\nI'd be for a landmark system like how Second Life has, where the world creator also has the option to enable/disable people to save the world, and the landmark can be given copies of to other players (whether or not they can actually go to a Friends-only/Friend-of-friend-only world depending on if they are actually friends).",
