      "value": "Several things here. \n\n1. Community Spotlight now helps highlight cool and interesting worlds of note. \n\n2. This next release will contain \"Community Labs\" a more advanced version of that. \n\n3. Recent Worlds, Favorite Worlds and Make this my Home World are all coming with this next major release. \n\nLater it'd be nice to look at friends and see their favorite worlds (if they allow this to be shown) \n\nHope that helps.",
